  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/pickletweaks?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fpickle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/pickletweaks/downloads&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fpickle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/pickletweaks/version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fpickle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/pickletweaks/mc_version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fpickletweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pickle Tweaks 添加了各種實用的 Vanilla+ 風格功能和調整。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組的所有功能均可在配置文件中單獨禁用。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合成網格工具修復：</strong>像在砧上一樣，使用修復材料在合成網格中修復你損壞的工具和武器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>帕克塞爾（Paxels）：</strong>斧頭、鎬和鏟子的結合體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>右鍵點擊作物收割：</strong>對完全成熟的作物進行右鍵點擊即可收割並重新種植。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工具信息提示：</strong>在工具的提示中添加挖掘速度和挖掘等級。同時在弓的提示中添加背包中有效彈藥的数量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>燧石與綠寶石工具：</strong>添加了由燧石和綠寶石製作的工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐮刀（Sickles）：</strong>用於以範圍效果（AOE）方式採集植物方塊的工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>大鐮刀（Scythes）：</strong>用於在區域內收割和重新種植作物的工具。也可作為範圍效果武器使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>HWYLA/Jade 可收割性提示：</strong>在 HWYLA/Jade 的提示中添加方塊的收割等級。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>澆水壺：</strong>增加區域內作物的生長速度。提供基本型（3x3）和加固型（7x7）兩種變體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>煤塊與木炭碎塊：</strong>每個可燒煉 1 個物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>夜視護目鏡：</strong>佩戴後賦予佩戴者夜視能力。提供基本型和加固型兩種變體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鑽石與綠寶石蘋果：</strong>提供額外增益效果的蘋果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>物品磁鐵：</strong>將物品和經驗球吸引到你身邊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>篩網：</strong>用於從礫石中合成燧石。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工具損壞調整：</strong>添加了一項調整，使工具和武器在損壞前無法使用最後一次，從而允許進行修復。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工具無用化：</strong>你可以在配置文件中指定某些工具不應能夠破壞方塊、造成傷害等。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
